<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Brasmotor, Multibras downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Brasmotor, Multibras downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said in a report it was downgrading Brazilian white goods makers Multibras and Brasmotor to hold from buy.  </p>
<p>-- Analyst Raquel Abud said her new ratings were based on expected credit restrictions to curb a higher-than-expected acceleration in imports.</p>
<p>-- Brasmotor preferred shares fell 4.51 percent to close at 275 reais while Multibras preferred stock ended at 1.30 reais, down 2.99 percent.</p>
<p>((-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415))</p>
